---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SectionHead from "../components/SectionHead.astro";
import Shot from "../components/Shot.astro";
import { APP, TRINETRA } from "../config/site";
import CurrencySwitch from "../components/CurrencySwitch.astro";
import Price from "../components/Price.astro";
import { PLANS } from "../lib/pricing";
const rolling = TRINETRA.status === "rolling_out";
const stages = ["Invoice", "Bank receipt", "Deductor evidence", "Uploaded statement", "Reviewed resolution"];
---
<Base title="TRINETRA — Credit assurance" description="Check whether the tax your customers withheld reached your tax statement. For Business and Enterprise: evidence for you and your accountant, never tax advice." path="/trinetra">
  <section class="page py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow">TRINETRA · Business and Enterprise</p>
    <h1 class="h1 mt-5 max-w-4xl">Trace withheld tax from invoice to government statement.</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-6 max-w-3xl">A customer says tax was deducted. Your records and the uploaded statement tell different stories. Bring the evidence together, review the difference and record what resolves it.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="btn-primary" href={APP.register}>Explore Servabo</a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/pricing">Compare plans</a></div>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-sm">{rolling ? "Rolling out. TRINETRA is opening to Business and Enterprise organizations in stages, after a chartered accountant has reviewed the wording and the statement readers have been checked against real statements. Official Form 26AS and Form 168 files are read only once that check is done; until then you can use Servabo's own template or an AIS file, and explore the synthetic examples below." : "Included in Business and Enterprise. You can use Servabo's own template, an AIS file or, once checked against your own statement, an official Form 26AS or Form 168 text download."} It shows evidence to review. It does not file anything, give tax advice, promise a refund or guarantee a credit.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="page py-12"><Shot name="trinetra" eager alt="TRINETRA in Servabo's existing shell: synthetic expected withholding, uploaded postings, possible gap, evidence stages and a selected case. No real tax or customer data." /><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Actual application screenshot with synthetic arithmetic examples. No real tax or customer data.</p></section>
  <section class="page py-12" aria-labelledby="trinetra-evidence">
    <SectionHead id="trinetra-evidence" title="Five sources. One reviewable explanation." lede="Expected deduction, bank cash, deductor assertions and statement postings remain separate facts." />
    <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-5">{stages.map((stage,i) => <li class="sheet-fold p-5"><span class="eyebrow">{i+1}</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">{stage}</h3></li>)}</ol>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="sheet-fold p-6"><h3 class="h3">Investigate the gap</h3><p class="mt-3">A missing posting is an evidence question. It does not establish evasion, eligibility or a guaranteed recoverable amount.</p></article><article class="sheet-fold p-6"><h3 class="h3">Keep the review history</h3><p class="mt-3">Compare later snapshots without rewriting earlier decisions. Ambiguous allocations wait for a person.</p></article><article class="sheet-fold p-6"><h3 class="h3">Use the records you have</h3><p class="mt-3">Servabo's documents and Helm bank evidence remain their canonical records. TRINETRA does not move money or change payment history.</p></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page py-12" aria-labelledby="trinetra-does">
    <SectionHead id="trinetra-does" title="What you do with it" lede="Servabo suggests and compares. A person decides, every time." />
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="sheet-fold p-6"><h3 class="h3">Bring in your statement</h3><p class="mt-3">Fill in Servabo's template or upload an AIS file. You see everything Servabo read before anything is saved, with every tax deductor number masked.</p></article><article class="sheet-fold p-6"><h3 class="h3">Find the invoices to check</h3><p class="mt-3">Servabo can point at invoices where a customer printed or reported TDS. Nothing becomes a case until a person accepts it with a reason.</p></article><article class="sheet-fold p-6"><h3 class="h3">Ask for the document</h3><p class="mt-3">A draft request to the customer, which a person edits, approves and sends. Nothing is ever sent on its own, and it accuses no one.</p></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page py-12" aria-labelledby="trinetra-plans">
    <SectionHead id="trinetra-plans" title="Additive capability. Existing plan prices." lede="Every plan can explore the synthetic examples. Business and Enterprise check their own statements, at the plan prices below; nothing is added to your bill." />
    <div class="mt-6"><CurrencySwitch /></div>
    <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left"><caption class="sr-only">TRINETRA plan availability</caption><thead><tr><th class="p-3" scope="col">Plan</th><th class="p-3" scope="col">Price per user, per month</th><th class="p-3" scope="col">TRINETRA</th></tr></thead><tbody>{PLANS.map((plan) => <tr class="border-t" ><th class="p-3" scope="row">{plan.name}</th><td class="p-3">{plan.monthly ? <Price amounts={plan.month} /> : <><span class="cur-inr">₹0</span><span class="cur-usd">$0</span></>}{plan.perSeat ? <span class="cur-inr">, GST extra</span> : ""}</td><td class="p-3">{plan.features.includes("capability.trinetra_all_workspaces") ? (rolling ? "Rolling out: everything in Business, plus every workspace and legal entity together, approval chains and the read API" : "Everything in Business, plus every workspace and legal entity together, approval chains and the read API") : plan.features.includes("capability.trinetra") ? (rolling ? "Rolling out: check your own tax statement" : "Check your own tax statement") : "Synthetic examples only"}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page py-12"><SectionHead title="Evidence assurance, with clear limits" lede="No tax portal credentials, automated portal access, return filing, tax advice, refund promises or autonomous inquiry sending. TCS and unverified statement formats are unsupported. A chartered accountant decides what a business may claim." /><a class="btn-secondary mt-6" href="/security">How Servabo protects your records</a></section>
</Base>
